Hi,

This release adds the new node evacuate command and
client support for modifying external files.

linstor-client 1.12.0
---------------------
 * Added node evacuate command
 * Added external files commands
 * Fixed parsing exos create ctrl_b_ip
 * Fixed backup machine readable outputs shouldn't be wrapped in list
 * Resource group added adjust command

https://pkg.linbit.com//downloads/linstor/linstor-client-1.12.0.tar.gz

python-linstor 1.12.0
---------------------
 * Added node evacuate command
 * Added external files support
 * Fix incorrect backup_delete parameter
 * API 1.12.0 compat

https://pkg.linbit.com//downloads/linstor/python-linstor-1.12.0.tar.gz

Linstor PPA:
https://launchpad.net/~linbit/+archive/ubuntu/linbit-drbd9-stack

Best regards,
Rene

